            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Elayne Lande"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I make several gallons per week in the summer. Neither coffee nor water do it for me, and I've been drinking AP for several years. Even in the winter, it's my water substitute. I don't strictly use this recipe. I mix mine with instant ice tea and Crystal Light lemonade. Even my 5 and 7 year old neighbor kids love it.",
